<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1759] .Net: Guid read/write is not platform-safe.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1759</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Two problems here:&lt;br/&gt;
1) We do not count for endiannes, so byte shifts might be invalid.&lt;br/&gt;
2) Guid doesn&apos;t have fixed layout. For this reason there are no guarantees that it will take 16 bytes.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12906539">IGNITE-1759</key>
            <summary>.Net: Guid read/write is not platform-safe.</summary>
